{#
	Tabler-like icon macro with inline SVGs.

	The tabler--core npm package ships CSS/JS only (no icon font or sprite),
	so icons are drawn as inline stroke SVGs. The `icon` macro maps a
	short name to a tabler-compatible path and renders a 24x24 stroke icon.

	Twig macros cannot access template-level variables, so the icon path
	map lives inside the macro body instead of a top-level {% set %} (a
	top-level set renders unreachable inside macro scope and produced empty
	<svg> elements).
#}

